(footprint "Bridge_GBPC_Heatsink_Boyd_6223BG"
	(version 20240108)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Boyd/Aavid 6223BG bridge-rectifier heat sink (DigiKey 6223BG-ND): square finned, bolt-on, 26.92 x 26.92mm base, 31.75mm fin height. Thermal: 9.4 C/W natural, 3.0 C/W @ 400 LFM (rated 3.0W @ 30C rise). Designed for the GBPC / KBPC metal-case square bridge (28.6 x 28.6mm, e.g. Vishay GBPC3510, KiCad Diode_Bridge_28.6x28.6x7.3mm_P18.0mm_P11.6mm). The bridge lies flat on the board and the heat sink stacks on TOP, clamped by a single screw through the bridge's central hole into the heat sink's tapped 0.163in/M4 hole - so this footprint is a MECHANICAL KEEPOUT ONLY with no copper pads or board drill. Place the origin (central bolt axis) over the GBPC body centre. Courtyard is the projected 26.92mm base. VERIFY screw/standoff hardware and clearance to the enclosure lid before fabrication - the part stands 31.75mm tall above the bridge.")
	(tags "heatsink bridge rectifier GBPC KBPC 6223BG Boyd Aavid bolt-on")
